One person said this, surrender.

00:46:40.900 --> 00:46:43.040
I said, bingo, that's the key.

00:46:43.040 --> 00:46:44.820
We were gonna get there to Mark chapter eight,

00:46:44.820 --> 00:46:46.700
as eventually we were gonna end up.

