but the Holy Spirit wants all of us.

00:46:56.940 --> 00:47:01.700
And our God is a jealous God, and he wants all of us.

00:47:01.700 --> 00:47:04.580
He wants us to have, as we read in Romans chapter 12,

00:47:04.580 --> 00:47:07.260
to present our bodies a living sacrifice,

00:47:07.260 --> 00:47:10.540
holy, acceptable unto God,

00:47:10.540 --> 00:47:14.240
which is your reasonable service.

00:47:14.240 --> 00:47:16.820
But we look at that in Romans chapter 12

00:47:16.820 --> 00:47:18.140
at the end of verse number one,

00:47:18.140 --> 00:47:20.420
that's the super Christian.

00:47:21.460 --> 00:47:24.820
But God says that's just reasonable service.

00:47:26.260 --> 00:47:29.700
When I truly understand all that he's done for me,

00:47:30.700 --> 00:47:33.460
how could I not wanna live for him?

00:47:34.700 --> 00:47:37.860
We come to that place of recognizing

00:47:37.860 --> 00:47:40.500
that the friendship and the love of the world

00:47:40.500 --> 00:47:44.620
is enmity with God, but it grieves the Holy Spirit,

00:47:44.620 --> 00:47:47.340
and we have all of him, and he wants all of us.

00:47:47.340 --> 00:47:50.580
And I would say that humility is required.

00:47:50.580 --> 00:47:52.300
In verse number six, the Bible says,

00:47:52.300 --> 00:47:56.820
but he giveth more grace.

