Humility is required.

00:48:07.820 --> 00:48:12.020
Humility to acknowledge how our conduct

00:48:12.020 --> 00:48:14.360
is both wrong and destructive.

00:48:16.500 --> 00:48:18.700
I shared with you, after I went to a pastor's meeting

00:48:18.700 --> 00:48:22.140
a year ago, how this man stood up and made this comment

00:48:22.140 --> 00:48:24.780
that he'd been married for 35 years or something,

00:48:24.780 --> 00:48:27.100
and never had an argument one time with his wife,

00:48:27.100 --> 00:48:30.100
never said anything, never raised his voice one time,

00:48:30.100 --> 00:48:31.860
and he was talking about all this kind of stuff,

00:48:31.860 --> 00:48:33.620
and then he said this, there were plenty of times

00:48:33.620 --> 00:48:34.860
that I just didn't talk.

00:48:35.860 --> 00:48:37.360
Listen, that's not any better.

00:48:39.020 --> 00:48:40.460
Amen?

00:48:40.460 --> 00:48:42.380
That's not resolving conflict.

00:48:43.340 --> 00:48:45.740
Silent treatment is not godly.

00:48:47.060 --> 00:48:49.620
Well, I'm glad you didn't say something

00:48:49.620 --> 00:48:50.540
that's gonna get you in trouble,

00:48:50.540 --> 00:48:53.480
but that's not the right response.

00:48:54.400 --> 00:48:56.400
So what does humility do?

00:48:56.400 --> 00:49:00.280
Well, humility acknowledges that my conduct is wrong

00:49:00.280 --> 00:49:03.760
and my conduct is destructive as I humble myself

00:49:03.760 --> 00:49:07.800
and I come before the Lord, I humble myself before the Lord,

00:49:07.800 --> 00:49:10.720
but if there's that conflict in those wars

00:49:10.720 --> 00:49:13.600
and those fightings, what does the book of Proverbs tell us?

00:49:13.600 --> 00:49:16.680
It says, only by pride cometh contention.

00:49:18.120 --> 00:49:20.760
There's a lot of contention here amongst these,

00:49:20.760 --> 00:49:22.400
and there was a need for humility.

00:49:22.400 --> 00:49:23.240
Why?

00:49:23.240 --> 00:49:25.920
Because God resisteth the proud,

00:49:25.920 --> 00:49:28.320
but giveth grace unto the humble.

00:49:28.320 --> 00:49:31.840
And we see that necessity for humility

00:49:31.840 --> 00:49:33.760
and how it's required, and listen,

00:49:33.760 --> 00:49:36.720
humility will lead to confession.

00:49:36.720 --> 00:49:39.640
Humility will lead to reconciliation.

00:49:39.640 --> 00:49:41.600
Humility will lead to healing.

00:49:42.880 --> 00:49:43.720
It will.

00:49:45.040 --> 00:49:48.280
Pride, not gonna lead to any of those things.

00:49:49.600 --> 00:49:51.480
Let me tell you how you were wrong.

00:49:52.840 --> 00:49:54.080
Not a good way to start.

00:49:55.960 --> 00:49:56.800
Right?

