as one, but with God's help and by God's grace.

00:51:32.380 --> 00:51:41.420
A church, we're many members, right, individuals, but we're brought together as a single body.

00:51:41.420 --> 00:51:47.460
And you come in, and I've used the phraseology, when there's new sheep in the pen, quote unquote,

